# Pause: F3 shows the pause text (id 2003, code 89) in the frame of the key press, the
# rule keys stay frozen for 449 frames, a second F3 at 851 clears it and shows the resume text (id 2004, code 91).
# The current mode's text redisplayed at f+450 through the 0x3f1 -> 0x50 remap is the 851-852 expect
# below: the game is in mode 10 here (NewGame start; the plunger pull at
# 200 did not leave it: mode == 0 delta 401 at 850 only says it did not change after the pause), text 3066.
init window 960 666
init fixed_dt 10
init seed 1
10 key down new_game
11 key up new_game
200 key down plunger
300 key up plunger
400 key down pause
401 key up pause
400 expect text info_text_box display id 2003
400 expect text info_text_box display code 89
850 expect mode == 0 delta 401
850 expect ball_save == 0 delta 401
851 key down pause
852 key up pause
851-852 expect text info_text_box display id 2004
851-852 expect text info_text_box display id 3066
900 quit
